# shadcn/ui

This project uses [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com) for **all** UI elements. Do not build custom buttons, inputs, dialogs, cards, or other primitives when a shadcn component exists.

Config lives in [components.json](mdc:components.json). Installed components belong in `@/components/ui`. Shared helpers live in [lib/utils.ts](mdc:lib/utils.ts).

## Setup

If shadcn is not initialized (no `components.json`), run:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest init
```

If a needed component is not installed (no matching file under `components/ui`), add it with the CLI. Example for Button:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add button
```

Use the same pattern for other components (`card`, `dialog`, `input`, `label`, etc.).

## Usage

Import from `@/components/ui/<component>` after adding. Do not copy-paste component source by hand or invent parallel UI kits.
